# Folder synchronization, a run that is stopped (specs/003-folder-sync US8). Run after 15-sync-limits.walk with the same server and folders: the plan of the Big pair is
# approved and the app is closed while the 120 MB file is on its way. The next walk shows what the pair says after the restart.
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncPairRow 2
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals download
tap planApprove
wait 50
quit
